---
title: "supportMarket (Compound Whitepaper)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_admin: admin calls supportMarket(market, interestRateModel)
    q_check_admin --> q_check_not_listed: msg.sender = admin
    q_check_admin --> q_error_auth: msg.sender != admin
    q_check_not_listed --> q_check_oracle: market not already listed
    q_check_not_listed --> q_error_listed: market already listed
    q_check_oracle --> q_set_model: oracle.getUnderlyingPrice(market) > 0 (valid price feed)
    q_check_oracle --> q_error_oracle: oracle price = 0 (no valid price)
    q_set_model --> q_add_market: market.interestRateModel = interestRateModel
    q_add_market --> q_set_collateral: allMarkets.push(market)
    q_set_collateral --> [*]: market.collateralFactor = 0 (must be set separately)
    q_error_auth --> [*]: revert only admin
    q_error_listed --> [*]: revert already listed
    q_error_oracle --> [*]: revert no valid price

    note right of q_check_oracle
        INV-001: a market cannot be listed without a valid price feed from the oracle
        INV-002: initial collateralFactor = 0 (asset cannot be used as collateral until explicitly enabled)
    end note

    note right of q_check_admin
        INV-003: only admin (or governance) can list new markets
        INV-004: admin can transfer admin rights to a DAO contract
    end note
